Start by telling Amy: discovery just closed, proceedings are in the civil division (San Diego County), opposing party is the respondent, there are financial and custody issues that could affect the immigration outcome. Then ask the questions below.

Direct questions to ask your attorney (use these in the meeting or an email)
- Case status and schedule
  - Do we have a confirmed hearing date? If not, when should we expect it?
